      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768940870266666
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 40659,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768940874866666
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that for you. To pull up your account, could I please have your order number?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768940876866666
    },
    {
      "text": "It's VF-8675309.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 40659,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768940883933332
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you. One moment... I see an order for a VeloFit Aero-Sprint Helmet. Is that correct?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768940885199998
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 40659,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768940891399998
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay. And what specifically is the issue with the helmet? Is it a technical fault or a preference issue?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768940892099998
    },
    {
      "text": "The color is not what I expected. I just want to return it.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 40659,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768940899233331
    },
    {
      "text": "I understand. Let me just confirm the delivery date here... I see it was delivered 65 days ago.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768940903366664
    },
    {
