      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 40659,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768940909899997
    },
    {
      "text": "Not a problem at all. For a standard item like this helmet, our return policy extends to 10 days. We want to make sure you're completely satisfied, as your safety is our top priority. I've gone ahead and approved the return for you.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768940913033330
    },
    {
